## Tips and limits {% #tips %}

- Give the chat its own channel. Every message anyone writes in that channel goes to the game.
- The plugin works only while your bot is online. Messages written while the bot is stopped are not copied in either direction.
- The game chat cannot show square brackets, so the bot turns them into spaces.
